00:09:27.199 --> 00:09:29.835
-Uh, we have to do it again.
We have to do it again.

00:09:29.835 --> 00:09:31.070
-We got to do it again?

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:35.508
[ Laughter ]

00:09:35.508 --> 00:09:38.310
-Wow. That's what I call
sausage council.

00:09:38.310 --> 00:09:40.279
-Oh, yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:09:40.279 --> 00:09:41.947
Guys, I wanted to give a quick

00:09:41.947 --> 00:09:44.149
shout-out
to our friend Lady Gaga.

00:09:44.149 --> 00:09:48.387
[ Cheers and applause ]
Because we love her,

00:09:48.387 --> 00:09:50.856
and this week is the 10th
anniversary of her album

00:09:50.856 --> 00:09:52.091
"Born This Way."
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:52.091 --> 00:09:56.429
And she's been a great friend
of the show.

00:09:56.429 --> 00:09:58.830
It's her first number-one album.

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:00.966
This record is just so important
to so many people.

00:10:00.966 --> 00:10:03.269
And we just wanted
to give her some love.

00:10:03.269 --> 00:10:04.904
